  "extraction_notes": [
    "All curve points are manual digitizations of plotted traces on p. 3; curve values are typical pulsed characteristics unless the plot states another temperature.",
    "The output-characteristics figure visibly provides three traces. The upper trace is labelled in print as the VGS = 5 V, 4 V, 3.0 V group; its individual overlapping labels are not separable, so it is retained as one honest upper-trace series.",
    "The tabulated RDS(on) values are preserved with separate typical and maximum entries where both are published. The 4.5 V row publishes only a maximum.",
    "The datasheet provides no capacitance-versus-VDS figure, so no capacitance curve was fabricated. Ciss, Coss, and Crss are transcribed from the 30 V, 1 MHz table condition.",
    "Only RthetaJA is published. No RthetaJC value is available in the supplied datasheet.",
    "The transfer and output figures are pulsed characteristics. The transfer plot contains separate Ta = 25 \u00b0C and Ta = 100 \u00b0C traces at VDS = 5.0 V.",
    "The threshold typical value is digitized from the 25 \u00b0C point in the Threshold Voltage plot; the tabulated threshold row publishes only MIN and MAX."
  ],
  "family": "mosfet",
